# ゼノギアス (Xenogears, SLPS-01160): the game's own codes, as the script has them. One byte a character, or two
# when the first is 0xF8 to 0xFE. Each was read in play: the codes of a message the game was showing beside
# the characters on screen. 144 codes from the opening's narration, the first scene and the hero's room; the
# rest of the font isn't read, and a code not here comes out as U+FFFD.
